context:
DELETE /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/pagerules/{pagerule_id}
Deletes an existing Page Rule.
Required: pagerule_id (path); zone_id (path)

PATCH /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/pagerules/{pagerule_id}
Updates one or more fields of an existing Page Rule.
Required: pagerule_id (path); zone_id (path); body (body)

GET /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/pagerules/{pagerule_id}
Fetches the details of a Page Rule.
Required: pagerule_id (path); zone_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/pagerules/{pagerule_id}
Replaces the configuration of an existing Page Rule. The configuration of the updated Page Rule will exactly match the data passed in the API request.
Required: pagerule_id (path); zone_id (path); body (body)
